Pantheon formulation

This suggests another operator:

Reverse Azimuth Operator

Purpose

Recover identity from relational bearings rather than stored state.

Pipeline

Object
      ↓
Extract relational bearings
      ↓
Discard local syntax
      ↓
Store only invariant relations
      ↓
Reconstruct in any domain

